          "source": "def heapreplace_max(heap, item):\n    \"\"\"Maxheap version of a heappop followed by a heappush.\"\"\"\n    returnitem = heap[0]    # raises appropriate IndexError if heap is empty\n    heap[0] = item\n    _siftup_max(heap, 0)\n    return returnitem",
